---
/* Problem Section */
---

<section id="problem" class="py-24 md:py-32 bg-core-background relative">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
        <div class="max-w-3xl mb-20 reveal">
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-ember mb-4">
                The problem
            </p>
            <h2 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-5xl text-core-text-primary leading-[1.15]">
                Your best ideas deserve more than a <span class="text-core-text-disabled line-through decoration-brand-ember/30">notes app graveyard.</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="mt-5 text-lg text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
                You think 10x faster than you can organize. By the time you've opened a doc and formatted a heading, the spark is gone.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
            <!-- Card 1 -->
            <div class="reveal delay-1 group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-core-surface border border-semantic-border/30 hover:border-brand-ember/30 hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <span class="absolute top-8 right-8 font-heading text-6xl text-core-text-disabled/10 leading-none select-none">01</span>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand-ember-mist flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-ember" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v7a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V5a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z"/><path d="M19 10v1a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-1"/><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="22"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl text-core-text-primary mb-3">Capture Friction</h4>
                <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-[0.95rem]">
                    Brilliant ideas hit in the shower, on a walk, mid-commute. Typing them out in a structured way feels like work — so you don't. And then they're gone forever.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 2 -->
            <div class="reveal delay-2 group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-core-surface border border-semantic-border/30 hover:border-brand-sage/30 hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <span class="absolute top-8 right-8 font-heading text-6xl text-core-text-disabled/10 leading-none select-none">02</span>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-green-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-sage" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"/><path d="M11 8v6"/><path d="M8 11h6"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl text-core-text-primary mb-3">Research Paralysis</h4>
                <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-[0.95rem]">
                    Starting a new project means hours of digging through docs, comparing libraries, and choosing a stack. The research alone kills your excitement before you write a single line.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Card 3 -->
            <div class="reveal delay-3 group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-core-surface border border-semantic-border/30 hover:border-brand-flax/30 hover:shadow-card transition-all duration-300">
                <span class="absolute top-8 right-8 font-heading text-6xl text-core-text-disabled/10 leading-none select-none">03</span>
                <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-2xl bg-yellow-50 flex items-center justify-center mb-6 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-flax" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M8 2v4"/><path d="M16 2v4"/><rect width="18" height="18" x="3" y="4" rx="2"/><path d="M3 10h18"/><path d="m9 16 2 2 4-4"/></svg>
                </div>
                <h4 class="font-heading text-xl text-core-text-primary mb-3">The "What Now?" Loop</h4>
                <p class="text-core-text-secondary leading-relaxed text-[0.95rem]">
                    Side projects stay in the backlog because they feel too big. You don't have time to break down a full-stack app into bite-sized tasks — so you never start.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Quote block -->
        <div class="mt-16 reveal">
            <div class="relative rounded-3xl overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-core-text-primary via-core-text-primary to-core-text-primary/90"></div>
                <div class="relative p-10 md:p-14 flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center gap-10">
                    <div class="flex-1">
                        <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-brand-ember/40 mb-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M14.017 21v-7.391c0-5.704 3.731-9.57 8.983-10.609l.995 2.151c-2.432.917-3.995 3.638-3.995 5.849h4v10h-9.983zm-14.017 0v-7.391c0-5.704 3.748-9.57 9-10.609l.996 2.151c-2.433.917-3.996 3.638-3.996 5.849h3.983v10h-9.983z"/></svg>
                        <blockquote class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading text-core-background/90 leading-snug">
                            I have 100 ideas, but after a 9-to-5 and university assignments, I just don't have the mental energy to plan them out.
                        </blockquote>
                        <cite class="mt-5 block text-sm text-core-background/40 not-italic">— Every developer with a side project graveyard.</cite>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hidden md:block w-px h-24 bg-core-background/10 flex-shrink-0"></div>
                    <div class="flex-1 md:pl-4">
                        <p class="text-lg text-core-background/70 leading-relaxed">
                            Blisp handles the <span class="text-brand-ember font-semibold">research</span>, <span class="text-brand-flax font-semibold">planning</span>, and <span class="text-semantic-info font-semibold">scheduling</span> so you can get back to the only part that matters:
                        </p>
                        <p class="mt-3 font-heading text-3xl text-core-background">Building.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
